    <briefdescription>
<para>Application lifecycle, the route from the reader to the processor, and the two model event handlers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The message thread runs the constructor, initialise, and the model listener. The reader callback, which <ref refid="class_whatdbg" kindref="compound">Whatdbg</ref> sets in its constructor, runs on the reader thread. The numMessages change flushes queued messages to the writer. The isRunning change to zero quits the application. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
